        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana FP155U32D, Contemporary Satin Stainless Steel Cup Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Satin Stainless Steel Rectangular Flush Pull is for use on pocket doors, sliding doors, cabinet doors--any door where a flush with the door face pull is desired. The Satin Stainless Steel finish makes it great for high traffic doors and for homes with a modern design aesthetic. Easy to install, it is packaged as a complete set with mounting hardware for one side of a pocket door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-FP155-Specifications.gif?v=1704354583\" width=\"375\" height=\"252\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Deltana FP155U32D Stainless Steel Cup Pull Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana FP155U32D Contemporary Stainless Steel Flush Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: 1/16\" Thick Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Depth: 7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Hole Depth: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with matching satin stainless mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FP155U32D.pdf?v=1704262227\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana FP155U32D  Dimensions  Diagram (PDF)</a></b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
